  "summary": "babel-plugin-linaria-css-to-undefined preinstall drops Bun runtime to execute obfuscated payload",
  "details": "Package declares preinstall=`node setup.mjs`. setup.mjs downloads a Bun runtime from github.com/oven-sh/bun/releases (v1.3.13) to a temporary directory, chmods it executable, and invokes it against a shipped 727 KB single-line obfuscated JavaScript file `math_init.js` that uses a rotating string-array/opcode-table decoder. The advertised purpose is a small Babel visitor plugin (lib/index.js), which has no need for a second runtime; fetching Bun solely to execute a bundled obfuscated blob at install time is the alternate-runtime-dropper pattern, executing code under a runtime not resolvable by Node-based tooling. Package.json advertises the ornikar repository and author, consistent with impersonation or maintainer-account compromise of the upstream ornikar package.",
